ry NPC has a voice. They scream, beg, surrender, call for backup and take cover.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Soldiers flank you and throw grenades. Terrorists, gang members and junkies each fight differently.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Special zombies: runners, screamers that call the horde, acid spitters and bloaters that burst on death.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Armored juggernauts, riot shields, attack dogs, wolves and an enemy gunship.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▎WEAPONS<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Pistols, shotguns, rifles, a minigun, sniper rifles with bullet cam, a railgun, crossbows and rocket launchers.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Flamethrowers and molotovs that set voxels and people on fire.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Katanas, chainsaws, spiked bats, demolition hammers, throwing knives and a harpoon that pins people to walls.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Attachments: suppressors, red dots, scopes and lasers.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Reloads where the magazine drops to the floor with physics, plus tactical reloads and weapon inspection.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Aim down sights, slide, lean around corners, Max Payne-style dives in slow motion and kick doors down.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▎DESTRUCTION<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Buildings collapse block by block with structural analysis. The rubble crushes whoever is underneath.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Cars dent piece by piece, catch fire and explode.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Glass shatters, doors break off their hinges and walls crumble under explosions.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▎WORLD<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic day\/night cycle, rain, snow, fog and thunderstorms. Rain puts out fires.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Lakes you can swim and dive in, and bodies that float.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dynamic music that follows the action.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >▎AND MORE<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Photo mode with free camera, frozen time and filters.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 28 challenges, lifetime stats, kill streaks, a style meter and weapon skins.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Game modifiers and catastrophe mutators.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A built-in voxel editor to create your own props.<\/p>","short_description":"A brutal voxel gore sandbox. Every body is built from blocks you can shoot, slice, burn and blow apart. Play God: hurl people, strike them with lightning, hang them or impale them on spikes. Or grab a gun for Police raids, zombie waves and fully destructible cities.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, Russian, Spanish - Latin America<br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5352720\/c32da40c24de551d8f029740d528d436ad0603f9\/header.jpg?t=1793028648","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5352720\/430ed4ab5c19ba497bb2c0d0be5b5c0802521f79\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793028648","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5352720\/430ed4ab5c19ba497bb2c0d0be5b5c0802521f79\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793028648","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Dual-core 2.5 GHz (Intel Core i3 \/ AMD equivalent)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 2,048 MB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 3.3 compatible GPU (Intel HD Graphics 4000, GeForce GT 630, Radeon HD 7000 or better)<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 200 MB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> Any<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/l